; DNS for AI Discovery (DNS-AID) — draft-mozleywilliams-dnsop-dnsaid
; Publish in the OVH zone for double-slash.dev (ns17.ovh.net / dns17.ovh.net).
; DNSSEC already signs this zone; new records inherit signatures.
;
; ServiceMode (priority >= 1). TargetName is absolute (trailing dot) and
; must not contain underscores. alpn is h2/http1.1 — the site has no A2A/MCP
; server. Do not set experimental SvcParamKeys until IANA assigns numbers.

_index._agents.double-slash.dev. 3600 IN SVCB 1 double-slash.dev. alpn="h2,http/1.1" port=443
_a2a._agents.double-slash.dev. 3600 IN SVCB 1 double-slash.dev. alpn="h2,http/1.1" port=443
